.TP
.BR esc\-1 " through " esc\-0
Same as F1 through F10.
.TP
.B esc\-space
Insert the current draw character.
.TP
.BR esc\-c " or " Tab
Open the color picker.
.TP
.B esc\-left
Next foreground color.
.TP
.B esc\-right
Previous foreground color.
.TP
.B esc\-up
Change color, moving up the palette.
.TP
.B esc\-down
Change color, moving down the palette.
.TP
.B esc\-'
Insert line.
.TP
.B esc\-;
Delete line.
.TP
.B esc\-.
Insert column.
.TP
.B esc\-,
Delete column.
.TP
.B esc\-]
Next character group.
.TP
.B esc\-[
Previous character group.
.TP
.B esc\-S
Change character set.
.TP
.B esc\-L
Replace color.
.TP
.B esc\-y
Eyedrop (pick up color).
.TP
.B esc\-P
Pick up character.
.TP
.B esc\-l
Color character.
.TP
.B shift\-arrows
Select an area for copy.
.TP
.B esc\-K
Select an area for copy. (Mark selection)
.TP
.B esc\-v
Paste.
