.SH BRUSHES
To make a brush, select an area with
.B shift\-arrows
or
.BR esc\-K ,
then press
.BR b .
To paint with it, open the Mouse Tools menu
.RB ( esc\-t )
and select
.BR Paint " (" P ")."
You can then use the mouse to paint with your custom brush.
.SH "ANIMATION BRUSHES"
To make an animation brush, select an area with
.B shift\-arrows
or
.BR esc\-K ,
then press
.B b
followed by
.BR a .
To paint with it, open the Mouse Tools menu
.RB ( esc\-t )
and select
.BR "Animation Brush" " (" A ")."
You can then use the mouse to "paint" animation frames: clicking on the
canvas paints the current frame of the animation brush onto the canvas,
then both the animation brush and the canvas advance to their next
frame.
.El
.SH FILES
.TP
.I *.dur
Durdraw's native animation format, loaded and saved with
.B esc\-o
and
.BR esc\-s .
.TP
.I *.durf
Durfetch files
.TP
.I ~/.durdraw/themes/*.dtheme.ini
Durdraw theme files
.TP
.I /etc/durdraw/durdraw.conf
Global configuration file.
.TP
.I ~/.durdraw/durdraw.conf
User configuration file.
.TP
.I $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/durdraw/durdraw.conf
User configuration file.
